        "original_id": "f581f15c-0f9f-5584-8bc9-859e2283c480",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Meomi Design, Brown Bag Films, Silvergate Media\n- People: Vicki Wong, Michael C. Murphy\n- Places: Vancouver, Los Angeles, Canada, United States\n- Products: The Octonauts, Miga, Quatchi, Sumi, Mukmuk\n- Organizations: BBC, CBeebies\n- Events: Vancouver 2010 Winter Olympics\n\nFacts:\n- Meomi Design Inc is a Canadian/American design studio based in Vancouver and Los Angeles.\n- Meomi Design was founded by Vicki Wong and Michael C. Murphy.\n- Meomi Design created the Vancouver 2010 Winter Olympics mascots Miga, Quatchi, Sumi, and Mukmuk.\n- Meomi Design created The Octonauts as a series of books.\n- Brown Bag Films made The Octonauts books into a television series for the BBC channel CBeebies.\n- The Octonauts is a British children's television series.\n- Silvergate Media produced The Octonauts for the BBC channel CBeebies.\n- The Octonauts was subsequently broadcast internationally.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
